The user should also verify the MongoDB connection string format. The current setup uses "mongodb://${MONGO_USER}:${MONGO_PASS}@mongodb-geo:27017?authSource=${MONGO_AUTHDB}", which should be correct, but maybe the app expects a different format, like including the authSource in the URI differently.

