htliang2-agent.insai-pg0.apt.emulab.net\n  Normal   Pulled     46s (x4 over 94s)  kubelet            spec.containers{hotel-reserv-geo}: Container image "yinfangchen/hotelreservation:latest" already present on machine\n  Normal   Created    45s (x4 over 93s)  kubelet            spec.containers{hotel-reserv-geo}: Created container: hotel-reserv-geo\n  Normal   Started    44s (x4 over 92s)  kubelet            spec.containers{hotel-reserv-geo}: Started container hotel-reserv-geo\n  Warning  BackOff    9s (x8 over 89s)   kubelet            spec.containers{hotel-reserv-geo}: Back-off restarting failed container hotel-reserv-geo in pod geo-7747cc8444-dnbw9_hotel-reservation(a2bd077d-1d88-4a28-a583-2c277c7bf3d1)\n', id='54813914-3d97-4dcd-a912-8553d34110ed', tool_call_id='chatcmpl-tool-8838228349af2e80'), HumanMessage(content='You are now in the thinking stage. Choose a tool from the available tools and justify your choice.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='537afab5-4536-435f-be3d-de77099fafbe')]]
