 which can indicate if the MONGO_URI is correctly formatted and if the authentication is succeeding. If the logs show a successful connection, then the issue is fixed. If not, there might be another problem, like incorrect credentials or a network issue with MongoDB.\n\nSince the user is in the thinking stage, they need to decide the next step. The next logical step is to check the logs again to confirm the current state. If the logs show the error persists, they might need to verify the Secret's contents or check the MongoDB service's availability. But based on the previous steps, the most immediate action is to review the logs to see if the recent changes fixed the issue.\n</think>\n\n", additional_kwargs={'tool_calls': [{'function': {'arguments': '{"command": "kubectl logs -n hotel-reservation geo-685dfbbd98-htb9g -c hotel-reserv-geo"}', 'name': 'exec_kubectl_cmd_safely'}, 'id': 'chatcmpl-tool-a22686050e4ae771', 'type': 'function'}], 'provider_specific_fields': {'reasoning': None, 'refusal': None}}, response_metadata={'token_usage': {'completion_tokens': 421, 'prompt_tokens': 10385, 'total_tokens': 10806, 'completion_tokens_details': None, 'prompt_tokens_details': None}, 'model': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B', 'finish_reason': 'tool_calls', 'logprobs': None, 'model_name': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B'}, id='lc_run--019cfb3d-2b20-74e0-a273-5bd439861b29-0', tool_calls=[{'name': 'exec_kubectl_cmd_safely', 'args': {'command': 'kubectl logs -n hotel-reservation geo-685dfbbd98-htb9g -c hotel-reserv-geo'}, 'id': 'chatcmpl-tool-a22686050e4ae771', 'type': 'tool_call'}], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 10385, 'output_tokens': 421, 'total_tokens': 10806}), ToolMessage(content='{"level":"info","time":"2026-03-17T09:59:39Z","message":"TLS disabled."}\n{"level":"info","time":"2026-03-17T09:59:39Z","message":"Set global log level: info"}\n{"level":"info","time":"2026-03-17T09:59:39Z","message":"Tune: setGCPercent to 100"}\n\x1b[90m2026-03-17T09:59:39Z\x1b[0m \x1b[32mIN