ironment variables.\n\nSince the user has tried multiple times to apply the correct configuration and the pod still isn't starting, the next step might be to check the pod's environment variables to confirm they're set correctly. Using kubectl to describe the pod and check the environment variables would help verify if MONGO_URI is present. If it's not, there might be an issue with how the Deployment is configured. If it is present but the app isn't using it, the problem lies within the application code, which might need debugging or configuration changes beyond Kubernetes.\n</think>\n\n", additional_kwargs={'tool_calls': [{'function': {'arguments': '{"command": "kubectl describe pod -n hotel-reservation geo-7747cc8444-dnbw9"}', 'name': 'exec_kubectl_cmd_safely'}, 'id': 'chatcmpl-tool-97d281c58d8f7657', 'type': 'function'}], 'provider_specific_fields': {'reasoning': None, 'refusal': None}}, response_metadata={'token_usage': {'completion_tokens': 587, 'prompt_tokens': 13042, 'total_tokens': 13629, 'completion_tokens_details': None, 'prompt_tokens_details': None}, 'model': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B', 'finish_reason': 'tool_calls', 'logprobs': None, 'model_name': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B'}, id='lc_run--019cfb3e-b714-7b22-b504-0f2600caf6c1-0', tool_calls=[{'name': 'exec_kubectl_cmd_safely', 'args': {'command': 'kubectl describe pod -n hotel-reservation geo-7747cc8444-dnbw9'}, 'id': 'chatcmpl-tool-97d281c58d8f7657', 'type': 'tool_call'}], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 13042, 'output_tokens': 587, 'total_tokens': 13629}), ToolMessage(content='Name:             geo-7747cc8444-dnbw9\nNamespace:        hotel-reservation\nPriority:         0\nService Account:  default\nNode:             node0.htliang2-agent.insai-pg0.apt.emulab.net/128.110.96.31\nStart Time:       Tue, 17 Mar 2026 10:01:09 +0000\nLabels:           io.kompose.service=geo\n                  pod-template-hash=7747cc8444\nAnnotations:      kompose.cmd: kompose convert\n                  kompose.