 also check if the Secret was applied correctly. They can use `kubectl get secret mongodb-geo-auth -n hotel-reservation -o jsonpath='{.data}'` to confirm the data is there. If the Secret is missing or the keys are different, that's the root cause.\n\nIn the next tool call, the user should verify the Secret's contents and ensure the Deployment is correctly configured. If everything looks right, maybe the app needs to be restarted or there's a different configuration issue. But based on the current info, the main issue is the environment variables not being set, so the Secret reference in the Deployment is probably incorrect.\n</think>\n\n", additional_kwargs={'tool_calls': [{'function': {'arguments': '{"command": "kubectl get secret mongodb-geo-auth -n hotel-reservation -o jsonpath=\'{.data}\'"}', 'name': 'exec_kubectl_cmd_safely'}, 'id': 'chatcmpl-tool-bb63bd8b8228dba7', 'type': 'function'}], 'provider_specific_fields': {'reasoning': None, 'refusal': None}}, response_metadata={'token_usage': {'completion_tokens': 446, 'prompt_tokens': 16148, 'total_tokens': 16594, 'completion_tokens_details': None, 'prompt_tokens_details': None}, 'model': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B', 'finish_reason': 'tool_calls', 'logprobs': None, 'model_name': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B'}, id='lc_run--019cfb3f-a9f2-70f0-bd12-83be2ca04363-0', tool_calls=[{'name': 'exec_kubectl_cmd_safely', 'args': {'command': "kubectl get secret mongodb-geo-auth -n hotel-reservation -o jsonpath='{.data}'"}, 'id': 'chatcmpl-tool-bb63bd8b8228dba7', 'type': 'tool_call'}], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 16148, 'output_tokens': 446, 'total_tokens': 16594}), ToolMessage(content='{"authdb":"YWRtaW4=","password":"Z2VvLXByb2ZpbGVz","username":"Z2VvLXVzZXI="}', id='aaccc873-ef77-47e9-9472-dca49cd18b82', tool_call_id='chatcmpl-tool-bb63bd8b8228dba7'), HumanMessage(content='You are now in the thinking stage. Choose a tool from the available tools and justify your choice.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata=